@startuml
title Quotation Flow - Sequence View

actor User
participant "Quotation UI\n(Alpine)" as UI
participant "QuotationFlow\n(XState runtime)" as Flow
participant "ClientSelection" as ClientSelection
participant "Catalog / Basket" as WorkArea
participant "ValidationSummary" as Validation
participant "PricingEngine" as Pricing
participant "Store" as Store
participant "Persistence" as Persistence

== Browse ==
note over UI,Persistence
  Active units in `browse`:
  - QuotationFlow
  - Persistence
end note

User -> UI : Open app
UI -> Flow : initialize()
Flow -> Store : load initial reference data
Store --> Flow : clients / catalog metadata / settings
Flow --> UI : stage = browse

== Client ==
note over UI,Store
  Active units in `client`:
  - QuotationFlow
  - ClientSelection
  - Store
end note

User -> UI : Start quotation
UI -> Flow : startQuotation()
Flow --> UI : stage = client

User -> UI : Search/select client
UI -> ClientSelection : search(term)
ClientSelection -> Store : query clients(term)
Store --> ClientSelection : matching clients
ClientSelection --> UI : client options

User -> UI : Choose client
UI -> Flow : selectClient(clientId)
Flow -> Store : get client(clientId)
Store --> Flow : client record
Flow --> UI : stage = basket

== Basket Construction ==
note over UI,Store
  Active units in `basket`:
  - QuotationFlow
  - Catalog
  - Category
  - Item (catalog mode)
  - Basket
  - BasketDay
  - Item (basket mode)
  - PricingEngine
  - Store
end note

User -> UI : Search / expand catalog
UI -> Flow : setCatalogSearch(term) / toggleCategory(id)
Flow -> Store : query item family / resolved defs
Store --> Flow : category/items
Flow --> UI : catalog snapshot

User -> UI : Add item to basket
UI -> Flow : shipItemToSelectedDay(itemId, overrides)
Flow -> Store : get item(itemId)
Store --> Flow : item definition
Flow -> Pricing : calculate(item, context, overrides)
Pricing --> Flow : totals + rule activations
Flow --> UI : basket snapshot updated

User -> UI : Edit basket item
UI -> Flow : setEntryOverride(entryId, key, value)
Flow -> Pricing : recalculate(entry, context)
Pricing --> Flow : totals + rule activations
Flow --> UI : basket snapshot updated

== Validation ==
note over UI,Persistence
  Active units in `validation`:
  - QuotationFlow
  - ValidationSummary
  - Persistence
  - Export
end note

User -> UI : Validate quotation
UI -> Flow : advanceToValidation()
Flow -> Pricing : aggregate validation totals
Pricing --> Flow : subtotal / iva / total + active rules
Flow --> Validation : build validation projection
Validation --> Flow : rows + summary
Flow --> UI : stage = validation

User -> UI : Export CSV
UI -> Validation : exportToExcel()
Validation --> User : downloaded file

== Save ==
User -> UI : Confirm save
UI -> Flow : saveQuotation()
Flow -> Persistence : save(request)
Persistence -> Store : persist quotation
Store --> Persistence : saved quotation id
Persistence --> Flow : save done
Flow --> UI : stage = completed

== Completed ==
note over UI,Persistence
  Active units in `completed`:
  - QuotationFlow
  - Persistence
end note

User -> UI : Start new quotation
UI -> Flow : resetToBrowse()
Flow --> UI : stage = browse

note right of UI
  Alpine is the projection layer:
  render snapshots and map user intent inward.
end note

note right of Flow
  QuotationFlow is the behavioral core:
  it owns stage progression and coordinates
  Store, Pricing, Validation, and Persistence.
end note

note right of Store
  Store is a bounded access layer,
  not a raw DB dump.
end note

@enduml
